- **"16" Packaging Complete value** (green, bold) — contrast ~3.6:1 ❌ (fails normal text; borderline for large/bold text at 3:1)
- **"48" Awaiting value** (orange, bold) — contrast ~2.4:1 ❌

**Product catalogue section**
