- **Table column headers** (gray-blue uppercase) — contrast ~4.1:1 ⚠️ just under threshold

**Status badges**
- **"Complete"** (green text on pale green) — contrast ~3.1:1 ❌ for normal text
- **"Incomplete"** (orange text on pale orange) — contrast ~2.3:1 ❌
